         * </p>
         *
         * <pre>
         * {@code
         *     Map<String, Map<String, List<Person>>> peopleByStateAndCity = personStream
         *         .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(Person::getState, Collectors.groupingBy(Person::getCity)));
